Z ada.exceptions%s	a-except.adb		a-except.ali
Z system.secondary_stack%s  s-secsta.adb	s-secsta.ali
W unchecked_deallocation%s

U multprec_integer_numbers%s  multprec_integer_numbers.ads  ea235684 EE OO PK
W multprec_natural_coefficients%s  multprec_natural_coefficients.adb  multprec_natural_coefficients.ali
